Function: png_read_filter_row_sub4_msa
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: In the same tail case, LD_UB reads 16 bytes on the last iteration when fewer than 16 bytes remain, overreading by up to 15 bytes.

